 desktop domain::agent_settings, iOS AgentSettings.swift, Android AgentSettings.kt) replays `summaryCases`: schedule = `scheduleSummary(cron, tz)` of `schedule-picker.json` (`Every day at 09:00 (Europe/Vienna)`; a cron the rows cannot express reads `Cron …`); event = `copy.events[name]` for a builtin name, else `copy.event` with {name}; a disabled trigger appends ' · Paused'. validateAgentForm(form) replays `validationCases`: errors keyed by field, in field order: name blank (after trim) → copy.errors.nameRequired, over agentNameMax (contract sessionsSend) → copy.errors.nameTooLong, no device → copy.errors.deviceRequired, instructions over agentInstructionsMaxBytes UTF-8 bytes → copy.errors.instructionsTooLong; [] = valid.",
